        <mxCell id="legend-edge-link-text" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;object reference, not traffic&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="342" y="1338" width="168" height="22" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-legend-notes" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;Large dashed frame: infra perimeter · small: functional group&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;⚠ Gx&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: docs and code disagree, see &quot;Gaps&quot;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#475569;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="1610" width="440" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-steps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#059669&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Request path · a project dashboard&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt; A panel of the project&amp;#39;s Grafana org queries vmauth :8427 as user project-&amp;lt;p&amp;gt; (HMAC password, datasource pinned by Terraform).&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;2&lt;/span&gt; vmauth forwards to vmselect with extra_filters[]={namespace=~&amp;lt;project namespaces&amp;gt;}.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color:#0f172a;color:#ffffff;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 4px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;3&lt;/span&gt; vmselect reads vmstorage: the series of the three clusters, label cluster=onprem|aws|gcp.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="1260" width="560" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-bg" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ea580c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Background&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;A&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;B&lt;/span&gt; Logs: the project org queries the Loki gateway as grafana-projects with X-Scope-OrgID=&amp;lt;project&amp;gt;; the gateway proxies to Loki.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;C&lt;/span&gt; Org 1 (platform admins) reads vmselect directly, unfiltered.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;D&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;E&lt;/span&gt; The CMP reads vmselect directly and Loki as user cmp (activity, audit). It rewrites the Secret vmauth-projects: one user per project, namespaces from K3s labels and, for cloud projects, from its DB.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;F&lt;/span&gt; Argo Rollouts analysis queries vmselect :8481 on-prem; on EKS and GKE through the tunnel relay :18083.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;G&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;H&lt;/span&gt; vmalert evaluates the platform rules and fires to Alertmanager. &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;I&lt;/span&gt; The Loki ruler fires the security and log rules. &lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;J&lt;/span&gt; Alertmanager posts to Discord (default and critical).&lt;br&gt;• Dotted: the CMP patches the Secret vmauth-projects through the K8s API; vmauth reloads it every 30 s.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;K&lt;/span&gt; The CMP provisions each project org in Grafana: datasources, dashboards, alert rules and Discord contact points.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;L&lt;/span&gt; Grafana posts each project&amp;#39;s alerts to its contact point: the app webhook, else the project one, else the platform one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border:1px solid #0f172a;color:#0f172a;border-radius:3px;padding:0px 3px;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;M&lt;/span&gt; The CMP posts app health and budget alerts to Discord itself.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1160" y="1260" width="640" height="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-iso" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#e11d48&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;How a project sees only its own&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Metrics&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: vmauth user per project, filtered by namespace. NetworkPolicy vmselect-readers admits vmauth, vmalert, Grafana, CMP backend, Argo Rollouts, OpenCost and the WireGuard pods.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Logs&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: one Loki tenant per project (label cnp.3istor.com/project), set by Alloy at write and by the pinned header at read.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot;&gt;Grafana&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;: project admins are Editors in their org and cannot edit datasources.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1840" y="1260" width="500" height="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="card-gaps" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-ligatures:none&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#ea580c&quot;&gt;●&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0f172a&quot; style=&quot;font-size:13px&quot;&gt;Gaps&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:1.6&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;GO3&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; The vmauth filter matches namespaces only: a namespace name reused on two clusters would leak between projects.&lt;br&gt;• Org 1 and the CMP read vmselect unfiltered, by design: platform side only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#c2410c&quot;&gt;G7&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; CMP API auth (see the platform views).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=16;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=14;spacingRight=16;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Noto Sans Mono,DejaVu Sans Mono,monospace;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1e293b;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="560" y="1480" width="560" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
